<title>FRANCE: Eridania sees 96 net around 95 levels.</title>
<headline>Eridania sees 96 net around 95 levels.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The chairman of Eridania Beghin-Say predicted in a newspaper interview due for release on Saturday that while operating results will decline in 1996, net earnings should be around their 1995 level.</p>
<p>&quot;The first two months of the second half are encouraging. While operating results will be somewhat lower for the whole of 1996, net earnings should be around their 1995 level,&quot; Stefano Meloni told French weekly Le Journal des Finances.</p>
</text>
